Fixes:
- Write colours with transparency through color-mix instead of appending a hex alpha, so rgb(), hsl(), oklch() and 3- or 8-digit hex colours keep their tints.
- Key repeated rows by their place in the list, so two rows with the same text both draw and keep their own state.
- Columns held three cards, so a fourth spilled out; a card with a destination but no time never moved yet still took a slot there; and with fewer columns a card could sit off the board; columns now grow to their fullest moment and the board shrinks to fit, only a card with both a destination and a time moves, and every card is kept on the board.

